#
# OpenQOS colour scheme.
#
# Derived from Breeze Dark's key set — every section and key that Plasma 6 defines
# is present, so nothing silently falls back to a default — with the values
# replaced by the OpenQOS palette. The structure is deliberately identical so that
# a diff against BreezeDark.colors shows exactly the colours, and nothing else.
#
# Palette
#   deep         #0a1017  10,16,23    the darkest surface, used by the wallpaper
#   view         #0f1822  15,24,34    document and list backgrounds
#   window       #16212e  22,33,46    window backgrounds
#   surface      #1d2b3b  29,43,59    buttons, tooltips, alternate rows
#   ring         #2f4a66  47,74,102   the mark's ring, use as a dark accent
#   accent       #4c6e96  76,110,150  focus, selection, highlight — the same blue
#                                      as ANSI_COLOR in the os-release file
#   accent light #7fa6cd 127,166,205  active and hover states
#   text         #e8edf3 232,237,243  primary foreground
#   text muted   #8fa3b8 143,163,184  inactive foreground

